& [CanonicalIdentity] is the accepted Phase6 experiment authority
  + [canonical_specification_uuid] is f5157d4d-eea6-4a3a-af5b-12e2de5a4a4d
  + [source_snapshot_uuid] is d8d76cba-5a0d-4510-9b86-52faf2332af6
  + [conversation_uuid] is cab190f5-eda0-44e0-81a5-51f9605e0baa
  + [activation_state] is active_for_bounded_persistence_experiment
  + [implementation_language] is safe Rust edition 2024

& [AuthorityBoundary] is non-waivable
  = must: preserve EmbeddedRuntimeEnvironment, CompiledSourcePackage, TrustStore, SemanticFabric, ProtocolRequest, and ProtocolResponse as the logical oracle
  = must: reconstruct package order exactly
  = must: compare environment digests and exact query responses
  = must: readmit every reconstructed package before semantic use
  = must: keep candidate code outside the production runtime until adoption
  - never: let table shape, key order, SQL, or database metadata authorize meaning
  - never: claim cold-disk, production-scale, or terabyte performance from this experiment

& [CandidateSet] is complete for this decision
  + [JSON] is current whole-environment transparent snapshot
  + [SQLite] is transactional relational application file with indexed immutable package rows
  + [redb] is pure-Rust transactional key-value application file with ordinal immutable package values

& [AcceptanceGate] is PD-AC1 through PD-AC8
  @ [definition] C:\Project\Cantor\specifications\exploded\Cantor_Persistence_Evidence_Gate.exploded.sop

